<title>FRANCE: Casino 1996 turnover rises.</title>
<headline>Casino 1996 turnover rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					66,839    vs   64,130</p>
<p>	of which Q4				 18,162    vs   17,464</p>
<p>NOTE - The company gave the results in the official bulletin BALO.</p>
